~Version ---------------------------------------------------
VERS.   2.0 : CWLS log ASCII Standard -VERSION 2.0
WRAP.    NO : One line per depth step
DLM . SPACE : Column Data Section Delimiter
~Well ------------------------------------------------------
STRT.FT         8000.00000 : Start depth
STOP.FT        11000.00000 : Stop depth
STEP.FT            0.50000 : Depth increment
NULL.              -999.25 : Null value
COMP.         TEST COMPANY : Company
WELL.               WELL_E : Well name
FLD .      SYNTHETIC FIELD : Field name
LOC .                      : LOCATION
PROV.                      : PROVINCE
CNTY.                      : COUNTY
STAT.                      : STATE
CTRY.                      : COUNTRY
SRVC. SYNTHETIC SERVICE CO : Service company
DATE.           2024-01-01 : Log date
UWI .   42-000-00005-00-00 : Unique well identifier
API .   42-000-00005-00-00 : API number (synthetic)
~Curve Information -----------------------------------------
DEPT.FT    : Measured depth
GR  .GAPI  : Gamma Ray
CALI.IN    : Caliper
BS  .IN    : Bit size
RHOB.G/C3  : Bulk density
NPHI.V/V   : Neutron porosity
RT  .OHMM  : True resistivity
DT  .US/F  : Sonic travel time
PEF .B/E   : Photoelectric factor
